    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_032_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "1D7AA910BEAF177A",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好啊～[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好。\\n我是吉尼亞。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
